யம்","parts":[{"text":"களரி","lemma":"களரி","gloss":"dry saline soil"},{"text":"அம்","lemma":"அம்","gloss":"euphonic"}],"gloss":"of the wasteland"},{"surface":"பறந்தலை","parts":[{"text":"பறந்தலை","lemma":"பறந்தலை","gloss":"cremation ground"}],"gloss":"cremation ground"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முள்ளுடை","parts":[{"text":"முள்","lemma":"முள்","gloss":"thorn"},{"text":"உடை","lemma":"உடை","gloss":"possessing"}],"gloss":"thorny"},{"surface":"வியன்காட்டு","parts":[{"text":"வியன்காட்டு","lemma":"வியன்காட்டு","gloss":"vast forest"}],"gloss":"vast forest","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அதுவே","parts":[{"text":"அது","lemma":"அது","gloss":"that"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"that indeed"},{"surface":"நன்றும்","parts":[{"text":"நன்று","lemma":"நன்று","gloss":"good/well"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"very much"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சேட்சென்னி","parts":[{"text":"சேண்","lemma":"சேண்","gloss":"distant/great"},{"text":"சென்னி","lemma":"சென்னி","gloss":"Chola king"}],"gloss":"Cēṭceṉṉi"},{"surface":"நலங்கிள்ளி","parts":[{"text":"நலங்கிள்ளி","lemma":"நலங்கிள்ளி","gloss":"Nalaṅkiḷḷi"}],"gloss":"Nalaṅkiḷḷi"},{"surface":"கேட்குவன்","parts":[{"text":"கேள்","lemma":"கேள்","gloss":"to hear"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"future marker"},{"text":"வன்","lemma":"வன்","gloss":"he (personal suffix)"}],"gloss":"will he hear?"},{"surface":"கொல்","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"particle of doubt"}],"gloss":"indeed / particle of doubt"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னிசைப்","parts":[{"text":"இன்னிசைப்","lemma":"இன்னிசைப்","gloss":"sweet music"}],"gloss":"sweet music","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பறையடு","parts":[{"text":"பறையடு","lemma":"பறையடு","gloss":"with the drum"}],"gloss":"with the drum","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வென்றி","parts":[{"text":"வென்றி","lemma":"வென்றி","gloss":"victory"}],"gloss":"victory"},{"surface":"நுவலத்","parts":[{"text":"நுவலத்","lemma":"நுவலத்","gloss":"to declare"}],"gloss":"to declare","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தூக்கணம்","parts":[{"text":"தூக்கணம்","lemma":"தூக்கணம்","gloss":"weaver bird"}],"gloss":"weaver bird"},{"surface":"குரீஇத்","parts":[{"text":"குரீஇத்","lemma":"குரீஇத்","gloss":"bird"}],"gloss":"bird","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தூங்குகூடு","parts":[{"text":"தூங்கு","lemma":"தூங்கு","gloss":"hanging"},{"text":"கூடு","lemma":"கூடு","gloss":"nest"}],"gloss":"hanging nest"},{"surface":"ஏய்ப்ப","parts":[{"text":"ஏய்","lemma":"ஏய்","gloss":"to resemble"},{"text":"ப","lemma":"ப","gloss":"to (infinitive)"}],"gloss":"to resemble"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒருசிறைக்","parts":[{"text":"ஒருசிறைக்","lemma":"ஒருசிறைக்","gloss":"on one side"}],"gloss":"on one side","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொளீஇய","parts":[{"text":"கொள்","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"to hold"},{"text":"ஈஇய","lemma":"ஈஇய","gloss":"past participle"}],"gloss":"held"},{"surface":"திரிவாய்","parts":[{"text":"திரி","lemma":"திரி","gloss":"twisted/spiraled"},{"text":"வாய்","lemma":"வாய்","gloss":"mouth"}],"gloss":"spiraled mouth"},{"surface":"வலம்புரி","parts":[{"text":"வலம்","lemma":"வலம்","gloss":"right"},{"text":"புரி","lemma":"புரி","gloss":"spiral/conch"}],"gloss":"right-spiraled conch"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஞாலங்","parts":[{"text":"ஞாலங்","lemma":"ஞாலங்","gloss":"world"}],"gloss":"world","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காவலர்","parts":[{"text":"காவலர்","lemma":"காவலர்","gloss":"protectors/kings"}],"gloss":"protectors"},{"surface":"கடைத்தலைக்","parts":[{"text":"கடைத்தலைக்","lemma":"கடைத்தலைக்","gloss":"palace gate"}],"gloss":"palace gate","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"காலைத்","parts":[{"text":"காலைத்","lemma":"காலைத்","gloss":"morning"}],"gloss":"morning","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோன்றினும்","parts":[{"text":"தோன்று","lemma":"தோன்று","gloss":"to appear"},{"text":"இனும்","lemma":"இனும்","gloss":"even if"}],"gloss":"even if it appears"},{"surface":"நோகோ","parts":[{"text":"நோ","lemma":"நோ","gloss":"to feel pain/grieve"},{"text":"கோ","lemma":"கோ","gloss":"first person singular suffix"}],"gloss":"I grieve"},{"surface":"யானே","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"I indeed"}]}],"literal":"Those of the first class eating the sweet pulp of palmyra kernel / those of the middle class consuming the fresh ripe fruit / those of the lower class consuming roasted tubers with fibers from split mouths / encircling the land-abundant world in a clockwise manner / with the army of raised spears that destroyed the greatness of kings / listen now to the manifestation of what is called power! / The cremation ground of dry saline soil where cactus has grown / in that vast thorny forest indeed, / will Cēṭceṉṉi Nalaṅkiḷḷi hear? / To declare victory with the sweet-sounding drum, / resembling the hanging nest of the weaver bird, / the right-spiraled conch with a twisted mouth held on one side, / at the palace gate of the protectors of the world, / even if it appears in the morning, I grieve!","translation":"The noblemen ate the sweet pulp of the tender palmyra fruit. The middle-class folk consumed fresh ripe fruits. The commoners ate roasted tubers, peeling back the fibrous skin. Encircled by his army with raised spears that destroyed the pride of rival kings, he marched victoriously around this wide world. Listen now to what has become of that great power! It lies in the vast, thorny wasteland of the cremation ground where cacti grow. Will Cēṭceṉṉi Nalaṅkiḷḷi hear us? Even if the right-spiraled conch, with its twisted mouth resembling the hanging nest of a weaver bird, is held to one side and blown at the gates of the world's rulers to announce victory along with the sweet-sounding drums in the morning, I can only grieve!","modern":"உயர்ந்த குடியினர் பனை நுங்கின் இனிமையான பருப்பை உண்ண, இடைப்பட்ட மக்கள் நல்ல பழங்களை உண்ண, எளிய மக்கள் நார் பொருந்திய சுட்ட கிழங்குகளைப் பிளந்து உண்ண, நிலம் நிறைந்த உலகத்தை வலமாக வளைத்து, பகை அரசர்களின் பெருமையை அழித்த ஏந்திய வேற்படையுடன் விளங்கிய ஆற்றலின் இறுதி நிலையை இப்போது கேளுங்கள்! கள்ளிச் செடிகள் வளர்ந்த, முட்கள் நிறைந்த சுடுகாடாகிய அந்தப் பரந்த காட்டில்தான் அவன் இப்போது இருக்கிறான். சேட்சென்னி நலங்கிள்ளியால் இதைக் கேட்க முடியுமா? தூக்கணாங்குருவியின் தொங்கும் கூட்டைப் போன்ற, ஒரு பக்கமாக வளைந்த வாயைக் கொண்ட வலம்புரிச் சங்கு, உலகைக் காக்கும் அரசர்களின் அரண்மனை வாயிலில், இனிய முரசுகளுடன் வெற்றியை அறிவிக்கக் காலையில் முழங்கினாலும், நான் வருத்தமடைகிறேன்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Potuviyal tiṇai and the theme is Kaiyaṟunilai, which is a lament on the death of a great person. The poet Ālattūr Kiḻār mourns the death of the Chola king Nalaṅkiḷḷi, reflecting on the transience of earthly power. He begins by describing the prosperity of the kingdom, where people of all classes—high, middle, and low—happily ate their respective foods. The king, with his mighty army, had conquered the entire world, but now his great power has ended in a thorny, cactus-filled cremation ground. The poet wonders if the deceased king can still hear the morning victory drums and the sounding of the precious right-spiraled conch, which resembles a weaver bird's nest, at the palace gates. The contrast between the king's past glory and his final resting place highlights the inevitability of death.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.3],[1.3,1.66],[1.79,2.3],[2.3,2.8],[2.8,3.0],[3.0,3.4],[3.4,4.5],[4.5,5.32],[5.32,5.45],[5.45,5.73],[5.73,6.2],[6.2,7.4],[7.5,7.9],[7.9,8.0],[8.0,8.5],[8.5,8.66],[8.81,9.6],[9.6,10.1],[10.1,10.6],[10.6,11.6],[11.6,12.1],[12.1,12.3],[12.3,12.6],[12.6,12.8],[12.8,13.7],[13.7,14.0],[14.0,14.5],[14.5,15.0],[15.0,16.0],[16.0,16.43],[16.43,16.8],[16.8,17.3],[18.0,18.7],[18.7,18.8],[18.8,19.6],[19.6,20.0],[20.0,21.1],[21.3,21.5],[21.5,21.75],[21.75,22.01],[22.23,23.3],[23.3,23.83],[23.83,24.6],[24.67,24.9],[24.9,26.34],[26.52,26.7],[26.7,27.1],[27.1,27.6],[27.6,28.1],[28.1,28.4],[28.4,29.1],[29.1,30.1],[30.1,30.5],[30.5,30.8],[30.8,31.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.8],[1.8,2.2],[2.2,3.0],[3.0,3.5],[3.5,3.6],[3.6,4.0],[4.0,4.51],[4.51,4.51],[4.51,4.51],[4.51,6.8],[6.8,7.3],[7.3,7.3],[7.3,8.8],[8.8,9.1],[9.1,9.6],[9.6,9.6],[9.6,9.6],[9.6,11.8],[11.8,12.3],[12.3,13.4],[13.4,13.9],[13.9,14.0],[14.0,14.4],[14.4,14.7],[14.7,15.6],[15.6,16.0],[16.0,16.3],[16.3,16.3],[16.3,16.94],[16.94,17.27],[17.27,17.91],[18.23,19.2],[20.52,21.22],[21.22,21.42],[21.42,22.17],[22.29,22.42],[22.42,23.82],[23.92,24.76],[24.76,24.76],[24.76,25.4],[25.4,27.0],[27.0,27.0],[27.0,27.32],[27.32,27.82],[27.82,29.46],[29.64,29.82],[29.82,30.32],[30.32,30.82],[30.82,31.82],[31.82,32.02],[32.02,33.12],[33.12,34.12],[34.12,34.42],[34.42,34.72],[34.72,35.02]]}}